cing. Which promotion controls his queening square? } 6. a8=Q { Queen! From a8 she guards h1, so his pawn cannot promote safely. [%cal Ga7a8,Ga8h1] } (6. Kc4 { The c4 square looks natural for your king, but it changes the result. } 6... h1=Q 7. Kb5 7... Qa8 8. Kxb6 8... Kh6 { This way your queen misses h1 entirely, and the result has changed. [%cal Rg7h6] }) 1-0


